// Sizes of out-of-flow boxes: stretch-fit against fit-content, aspect
// ratios through stretched and set sizes, min and max sizes, padding and
// border as a floor, content-box sizing, the sizing keywords (min-content,
// max-content, fit-content, fit-content(), stretch), tables and replaced
// boxes, and percentages against the positioning area. The expected lines
// are taffy 0.15's own, from the same trees in Rust
// (/tmp/layout-port/oracle-oof).
